			"notes": "# Added relative position\nYou can now either set the position mode to _relative_ or _absolute_!\n\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01615dfb-a45b-43fe-a719-6fa5d885e74f)\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9dbe57c6-29d6-47d7-b659-f959682dab4c)\n\n## Added text alignment for absolute position\nIt is now possible to change the text alignment when using the absolute position mode!\n\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f015d1e5-3b1e-4aab-b06d-9048fcd708d5)\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd550576-4c71-4e98-af6b-e79b102bf7c1)"
